sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Admin client
    participant Front as Frontend onboarding
    participant API as API Bevoac
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MS as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant ARM as Azure Management

    Admin->>Front: Ouvre le portail onboarding
    Front->>API: POST /v1/onboarding/azure/start + Bearer API key
    API->>DB: Cree azure_onboarding_sessions + state_hash
    API-->>Front: authorizationUrl Microsoft + callbackUrl
    Front-->>Admin: Redirection vers Microsoft admin consent
    Admin->>MS: Consentement administrateur
    MS->>API: GET /v1/onboarding/azure/callback?tenant&admin_consent&state
    API->>API: Verifie signature HMAC, TTL, hash DB, status STARTED
    API->>DB: Upsert integration CONSENTED + tenant scope CONSENTED
    API->>MS: Client credentials token pour tenant client
    API->>ARM: GET /subscriptions
    alt subscriptions visibles
        API->>DB: Upsert subscription scopes VERIFIED
        API->>DB: Integration ACTIVE, session COMPLETED
        API-->>Front: 302 success.html?status=success
    else aucun RBAC ou erreur Azure Management
        API->>DB: Integration NEEDS_RBAC, session ACTION_REQUIRED
        API-->>Front: 302 success.html?status=action_required
    end
